From 3ccda6cdf3320c8fbcfbb2c8656c34a2827932af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: truthprobe <truthprobe@local>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:59:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] feat(truthprobe): score answers from token logprobs

- schema: Truthprobe.Info, capabilities.logprobs, AssistantText.truthprobe, optional truthprobe on session.text.ended
- ai/openai-chat: request logprobs/top_logprobs when enabled, parse choice-level logprobs into providerMetadata
- core: accumulate tokens per text block, score at text end and publish it with the durable text.ended event
- core/truthprobe: segmentation + scoring (phi_first, mean/min logprob per sentence)
- tui: first-sentence confidence badge and doubtful-sentence summary
