From 5a335e31658d33202b76ac0fb58f795cb1db4e03 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: truthprobe <truthprobe@local>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:36:25 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] fix(truthprobe): say so when tokens do not match the
 answer text

Dropping every token that cannot be found in the text silently produced
'unavailable / no content tokens'; the honest reason is that the stream and the
rendered text disagree.
